From a688fc88f2268e4ac6f67f21d6999b4c1c18caf1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:45:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(app): add the Gate map line to wcs_rotation_control

The xtask gate-map law requires a Gate map line in every app suite.
The header of wcs_rotation_control named no modules, so cargo test -p xtask failed on main.

Fixes #2361

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs b/crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs
index f1b15ef46..952c1b874 100644
--- a/crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs
+++ b/crates/app/tests/wcs_rotation_control.rs
@@ -2,6 +2,10 @@
 //! `viewer_map` Setup-coordinate invariance, and additional milling operations
 //! (`Pocket`, `Slot`, `Circular`, `Drill`, `Pocket3D` rest) under Z-rotated WCS.
 //!
+//! Gate map (#2361): covers app::commands, motion::drilling, geometry::geo2d, app::geometry,
+//! app::machine, app::model, app::operation, app::posting, app::schema, geometry::geometry::stock,
+//! app::world, tools::catalog.
+//!
 //! Provenance: our own integration suite for rotated work offsets; no vendor material consulted.
 
 use std::fs;
